# If Feral Thallid dies in response to its upkeep trigger, the new graveyard object gets no spore counter (CR 400.7).
[Bot1 Deck]
Feral Thallid
Black Lotus x2
Forest x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Feral Thallid.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Feral Thallid)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Feral Thallid.Counters.Spore = (absent)
